Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道  什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hmm. Oh, I don't know. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}照狗的年纪来算…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, as old as he is in dog years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你觉得史努比可以驾驶飞机吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...do you think Snoopy should still be allowed to fly this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋  什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Rachel? Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还记得你刚来的时候  另一位服务生训练你两星期吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Remember when you came, you spent two weeks getting trained by another waitress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然  你要我训练新人吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, sure. Do you need me to train somebody new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}很好笑{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha-ha-ha. Good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}事实上泰利要你再受训一次{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Actually, uh, Terry wants you to take the training again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等你有空的时候{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whenever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你相信吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}相信{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
