Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.91,0:01:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一共是两盒佳节杏仁饼干{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So that's two boxes of the Holiday Macaroons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我代表美国棕鸟(女童军团体)向您致敬{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}On behalf of the Brown Birds of America, I salute you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}承认吧  你的反手拍打不好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just admit it. You have no backhand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对不起  小家伙  我的反手拍打得非常好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me, little one. I have a very solid backhand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你用手挡住脸  跟小女孩一样蹲下来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Shielding your face and shrieking like a girl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那不算是反手拍{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...is not a backhand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的确蹲了下来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was shrieking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:01:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟海军陆战队一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...like a Marine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.31,0:02:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  听我说  你得做到冠军3P原则{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, here, watch me execute the three P's of championship play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}力量{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Power, huah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}精准{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...precision, shew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}架式{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and panache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你害一个小女孩摔断腿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You broke a little girl's leg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道  我很难过  好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know. I feel horrible, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}报上说昨晚有个布偶  在芝麻街被打了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It says here that a Muppet got whacked on Sesame Street last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}十点多时你在哪里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Where exactly were you around 10-ish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得去看她  买些东西送她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I'm gonna go see her. I wanna bring her something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你觉得她会喜欢什么   或许你该送她凯蒂猫娃娃{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What do you think she'd like? Maybe a Hello Kitty doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}行走能力{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The ability to walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得回去受训了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm gonna get back to retraining. Ahem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  大家再见{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. See you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小心点  孩子们  他来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Look out, kids. He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得去卖圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I gotta go sell some Christmas trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}祝你玩得开心  等一下  不  别那么做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Have fun. Oh, wait. No, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我忘了  我百分之百反对那种事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I forgot. I am totally against that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么   你反对我有工作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? Me having a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  我反对无辜的树  在青春正盛的时候被砍下…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no. I am against innocent trees being cut down in their prime...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}华丽地装饰它们的尸体{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and their corpses grotesquely dressed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}挂上一堆金箔和闪灯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...in, like, tinsel and twinkly lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你晚上怎么睡得着呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, how do you sleep at night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}整天搬树可把我累坏了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I'm pretty tired from lugging the trees around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比  听我说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, Phoebe, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你误会了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You got this all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那些树生来要当圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Those trees were born to be Christmas trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它们完成了毕生志愿   让大家感到开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They're fulfilling their life purpose by making people happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真的吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  树也很开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, and, uh, the trees are happy too...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为对多数的树来说  这是它们参观纽约的唯一机会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...because for most of them, it's their only chance to see New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}上饮料后  你得拿着空托盘…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}After you've delivered the drinks, you take the tray...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}阿甘  拜托  我在这里工作了两年半{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Gunther, Gunther, please. I have worked here for two and a half years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道空托盘得放在那边{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know the empty trays go over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}放在这里怎么样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What if you put them here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}知道吗  这倒是个好主意  离马克杯比较近{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, that's actually a good idea. They'll be closer to the mugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道吗  你该要求其他服务生也那么做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know what? You should have the other waitresses do that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们早就那么做了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They already do. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以他们叫这里是托盘区{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's why they call it "the tray spot."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我常听到他们那么说  我以为那是他们去玩的夜店{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I always heard them talk about that. I just thought it was a club they went to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔  天啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, God.{\r}
